### Create a new branch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/branches/branch
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "feature-one",
    "repoId": "6a0c36f2e3cf6aa5992cc0a1"
}

### Get all branches in a repository using repoId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/branches/repo/6a0c36f2e3cf6aa5992cc0a1

### Get a branch by branchId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/branches/branch/6a0595cb36624bd02b593724

### Get a branch using branch name from a repository
GET http://localhost:8080/api/branches/repo/6a02e3cc09325ae118e03f89/branch/feature-auth

### Deleting branch by id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/branches/repo/6a0594a805546ab2fcae09f3/branch/6a0594a805546ab2fcae09f4

